{"id":"torrey:bear-the","source":"torrey","name":"Bear, The","slug":"bear-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Inhabits woods — 2Ki 2:24.","refs":[["2Kgs",2,24,2,24]]},{"text":"Voracious. — Da 7:5.","refs":[["Dan",7,5,7,5]]},{"text":"Cunning. — La 3:10.","refs":[["Lam",3,10,3,10]]},{"text":"Cruel. — Am 5:19.","refs":[["Amos",5,19,5,19]]},{"text":"Often attacks men — 2Ki 2:24; Am 5:19.","refs":[["2Kgs",2,24,2,24],["Amos",5,19,5,19]]},{"text":"Attacks the flock in the presence of the shepherd — 1Sa 17:34.","refs":[["1Sam",17,34,17,34]]},{"text":"Particularly fierce when deprived of its young — 2Sa 17:8; Pr 17:12.","refs":[["2Sam",17,8,17,8],["Prov",17,12,17,12]]},{"text":"Growls when annoyed — Isa 59:11.","refs":[["Isa",59,11,59,11]]},{"text":"Miraculously killed by David — 1Sa 17:36,37.","refs":[["1Sam",17,36,17,36],["1Sam",17,37,17,37]]},{"text":"God in his judgments. — La 3:10; Ho 13:8.","refs":[["Lam",3,10,3,10],["Hos",13,8,13,8]]},{"text":"The natural man. — Isa 11:7.","refs":[["Isa",11,7,11,7]]},{"text":"Wicked rulers. — Pr 28:15.","refs":[["Prov",28,15,28,15]]},{"text":"The kingdom of the Medes. — Da 7:5.","refs":[["Dan",7,5,7,5]]},{"text":"The kingdom of Antichrist. — Re 13:2.","refs":[["Rev",13,2,13,2]]}],"refCount":18}
